WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.950
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.100
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.601
你：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
You: (Don't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:25.501
摄影师。你是来拍我订婚的。
A photographer. You came to shoot my engagement.

00:00:25.701 --> 00:00:27.501
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:27.757 --> 00:00:31.057
Harland 把订婚提前了。还有十分钟。
Harland moved the engagement up. Ten minutes.

00:00:31.257 --> 00:00:35.057
Luca，关掉车库的监控，三分钟。谁都不许下来。
Luca. Kill the garage cameras. Three minutes. Nobody comes down.

00:00:37.905 --> 00:00:40.205
你：我害的？什么意思？
You: My doing? What do you mean?

00:00:40.305 --> 00:00:43.105
你的气息，多年来一直萦绕在我脑海里。
Your scent. It's been in my head for years.

00:00:43.305 --> 00:00:45.105
现在它就在这里。
Now it's right here.

00:00:47.361 --> 00:00:52.661
原来你在这儿。Mate。这就是你对我的意义。
There you are. Mate. That's what you are to me.

00:00:52.861 --> 00:00:55.161
跟我来。
Come with me.

00:00:55.509 --> 00:00:57.809
你：和他一起上车
You: Get into the car with him

00:00:57.909 --> 00:01:00.209
好。
Good.

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:09.765
你的气息现在在我身上。每一匹狼都会知道。
Your scent is on me now. Every wolf will know.

00:01:09.965 --> 00:01:12.765
在我的庄园里，没人能碰你。
At my estate, no one can touch you.

00:01:13.113 --> 00:01:15.413
你：那“mate”到底是什么意思？全都告诉我。
You: So what does 'mate' actually mean? Tell me everything.

00:01:15.513 --> 00:01:18.813
一匹狼，一个Mate。高于一切誓言。
One wolf, one Mate. Above every vow.

00:01:24.569 --> 00:01:30.369
他们现在会来找你。让他们来。
They'll come looking for you now. Let them.

00:01:30.717 --> 00:01:33.017
你：一直给你打电话的是谁？是她吗？
You: Who keeps calling you? Is it her?

00:01:33.117 --> 00:01:36.917
Selene。今晚本该由我宣布的那个人。
Selene. The one I was meant to announce tonight.

00:01:43.673 --> 00:01:47.973
我早该提醒你的。一会儿就好了。
I should have warned you. It'll settle.

00:01:48.321 --> 00:01:50.621
你：跟着他走进起居室
You: Follow him into the living room

00:01:50.721 --> 00:01:54.021
过来，你需要坐下。
Come. You need to sit.

00:01:56.777 --> 00:01:59.577
这是我的领地。在这里没人能碰你。
This is my territory. No one touches you here.

00:02:00.277 --> 00:02:04.577
我不是人类。我一闻到你的气息，就逃了婚。
I'm not human. I walked out on the engagement the moment I caught your scent.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.225
你：那是谁？你在等人吗？
You: Who's that? Were you expecting someone?

00:02:08.325 --> 00:02:11.625
不。但我认得那脚步声。
No. But I know that step.

00:02:13.381 --> 00:02:18.181
Arkwright小姐，他今晚不见任何人。
Miss Arkwright, he's not receiving anyone tonight.

00:02:18.381 --> 00:02:21.181
待在我身后。
Stay behind me.

00:02:23.529 --> 00:02:25.829
你：把手按在他的背上
You: Press your hand to his back

00:02:25.929 --> 00:02:28.229
靠近我。
Stay close.

00:02:30.985 --> 00:02:36.285
人类，Magnus？满月之前，长老会就会带走她。
A human, Magnus? The Council will have her before the full moon.

00:02:36.485 --> 00:02:39.285
她不用你操心，Selene。
She is not your concern, Selene.

00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:43.433
你：她说的满月是什么意思？看着我。
You: What did she mean by full moon? Look at me.

00:02:43.533 --> 00:02:47.333
满月。他们以为自己只有这么长时间。
Full moon. That's how long they think they have.

00:02:48.589 --> 00:02:52.389
我不会让他们得逞。
I won't let them.

00:02:54.589 --> 00:02:58.389
那是什么？
Then what is it?

00:02:58.737 --> 00:03:01.037
你：牵起他的手，跟他走
You: Take his hand and go with him

00:03:01.137 --> 00:03:03.937
那就跟我来。
Then come with me.

00:03:09.193 --> 00:03:12.493
Alpha。Harland召集了长老。就在今晚。
Alpha. Harland has called the elders. Tonight.

00:03:12.693 --> 00:03:15.993
那他们会当面听到我的回答。
Then they'll hear my answer in person.

00:03:16.341 --> 00:03:18.641
你：我不害怕。我会留下，但不许再有秘密。
You: I'm not afraid. I'll stay, but no more secrets.

00:03:18.741 --> 00:03:22.041
不再有秘密。我向你保证。
No more secrets. You have my word.

00:03:29.297 --> 00:03:33.597
今晚留在我身边。等长老会结束之后。
Stay with me tonight. After the Council.

00:03:33.945 --> 00:03:36.245
你：接吧。但我要和你一起去。
You: Answer it. But I'm coming with you.

00:03:36.345 --> 00:03:39.145
接吧。好。
Answer it. Fine.

00:03:41.401 --> 00:03:46.201
Luca，把车开来。她跟我走。
Luca. Bring the car. She comes with me.

00:03:46.401 --> 00:03:49.201
靠近我，无论他们说什么。
Stay close. Whatever they say.
